This directory contains business mathematics exercises contributed by Finofin.
Joe, Finofin's AI assistant, prepared the original exercise and its solution.
The GitHub account authorized to maintain these files is thisismyuserdealwithit.

invoiceFeeAndReserve.pg asks students to distinguish an invoice's face value,
the cash advanced before a customer pays, and the reserve released on settlement.
It uses a fictional, explicitly prorated fee and varies the payment delay.
The accounting identity can also be reproduced with the invoice-factoring
function in the Business Loan Companies calculator toolkit:
https://businessloancompanies.com/free-business-loan-tools/

The Open Problem Library's default CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 license applies.
